bservados y esperados es 6,9, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 3,6 a 13,5. En diciembre se adjudicó el 4 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 7 % de todos sus contratos de obras. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 5 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 38.900 euros, se adjudicó en octubre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: El hecho de que se adjudiquen contratos cerca del límite no indica que haya sido un error. Puede deberse a razones legales o a necesidades específicas.\nQué se puede revisar: Es importante comprobar si los contratos [1] y [2] atienden la misma necesidad. También revisar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en distintas áreas. Verificar si los contratos de diciembre se relacionan con otros adjudicatarios.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 25 minor contracts for works above 37,500 and up to 40,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 3.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 6.9, with a 95% confidence interval of 3.6 to 13.5. December accounts for 4% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 7% of all its works contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 9. Contract [1], for 38,900 euros, was awarded in October 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The fact that many contracts are just under the legal limit does not prove any wrongdoing. It could be due to market prices or budget constraints. Statistical indicators like this do not indicate improper actions by individuals or organizations.\nWhat can be checked: Check the details of contract [1] to see what was purchased and the dates. Look at awardee A’s contracts to see if they are for similar needs. Review if multiple contracts cover the same requirement to ensure no duplication or overlap.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["iCFTYeUPUresNfRW6APEDw%3D%3D","91Iv3npNmDS7JOCXkOhcDg%3D%3D","gV9%2FDy2JLUrLIx6q1oPaMg%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}